OL,3,AMy self-care ritual is a meal at a     
OL,4,Afancy restaurant - on my own           
OL,6,FCatherine Smith is perusing the menu at
OL,7,Fa high-end Mediterranean restaurant she
OL,8,Fhas been excited to try. She has a new 
OL,9,Foutfit on, and as she sips her rose,   
OL,10,Fshe looks across at the empty seat     
OL,11,Fopposite - bliss.                      
OL,13,F"I think what is so special about solo 
OL,14,Fdining is that you don't have to wait  
OL,15,Ffor people to make those plans. You can
OL,16,Fgo out and do them yourself," says the 
OL,17,F23-year-old.                           
OL,19,FThe self-confessed foodie is part of a 
OL,20,Fgrowing trend of people booking tables 
OL,21,Ffor one - not because they're away with
OL,22,Fwork but as a treat.                   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
