OL,3,AMy self-care ritual is a meal at a     
OL,4,Afancy restaurant - on my own           
OL,6,FAs food trends analyst Charles Banks   
OL,7,Fputs it: "[Eating alone] is becoming an
OL,8,Fintentional act, a little pocket of    
OL,9,Findependence, indulgence and           
OL,10,Fself-care."                            
